der Wilderness, so it is stored as a Wilderness entry limited to that one skill at +5% and Espionage holds Intelligence alone. Hand to Hand: Expert (or Assassin if evil) with no price is stored as a free change. || MONEY: 1D6x1000 credits (the text layer prints !D6xlOOO); the salary of about 1,500 credits a month and a small percentage of booty is in GM Notes. || VEHICLES not stored: the Wingrider Flying Wing with corresponding Wingrider power armor and jet pack are vehicles from this book''s Vehicle Section, imported separately. || EQUIPMENT not stored as rows: an energy pistol and rifle of choice and one other weapon of choice; a CD player with 2D6 discs, two rocket flares, two uniforms denoting War Camp and Warlord, casual clothing and personal items have no catalog row and are in GM Notes. The light body armor is the generic light M.D.C. row since the book names no model."
